## The dome fragment, slot 0 of the staggered set (the sky rotates 15
## degrees/hour; a load-once page would otherwise drift visibly under the
## live satellite marker).  The body -- and the why of the stagger --
## lives in dome-svg-frag.inc; this file keeps its pre-stagger name so a
## page opened before an upgrade keeps refetching successfully.  Named
## .txt so the *.html validator cron never sees a bare SVG fragment.
